        "id": 13777,
        "name": "Natediggadoggity",
        "username": "Natediggadoggity",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-17T02:50:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well yeah, Deadline likes to destroy the environment deck, I haven't played him yet myself though, how often does that happen? Is he flipping every couple turns? or does it often take awhile? Do the heroes usually die before he ever gets that far?</p><p>What about on advanced?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And somewhat facetiously, has he ever destroyed a particularly annoying environment, and everyone just went \"yay, thank goodness that place is destroyed. Good job Deadline!\" (Like Rook City or something)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:40.987Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
