      {
        "id": 149653,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-18T03:41:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, unless you have really reliable ongoing destruction, he flips about every other round. Your best bet will be to hit him as hard as you can, as much as you can.</p>\n<p>We never look at the environment cards he removed, which introduces a lot of uncertainty…you can’t bank on the environment doing things, but sometimes the environment doesn’t do its nastiest things!</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:28:10.004Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
